{
  "file": "module4",
  "page": 198,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        67.39069366455078,
        527.3904418945312,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "The effect that different types of treatment support provider had on outcomes was also examined.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        527.415771484375,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "Treatment support provided by health-care workers and treatment support provided by lay persons",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        92.51471710205078,
        527.4288940429688,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "(18, 21, 32, 47–51) were compared. Only observational studies were available in the literature  . There",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        106.99073028564453,
        527.5938110351562,
        121.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "were no significant differences although slightly higher rates of success – and lower rates of mortality,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.990896224975586,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        120.19074249267578,
        527.4508666992188,
        134.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "failure and loss to follow-up – were observed among patients who had received treatment support",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        133.3907012939453,
        380.38525390625,
        147.8336944580078
      ],
      "text": "administered by a lay provider as opposed to a health-care worker.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        155.09461975097656,
        527.381591796875,
        169.53761291503906
      ],
      "text": "When provision of treatment support by a family member was compared to health-care worker",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        168.2946319580078,
        527.5289916992188,
        182.7376251220703
      ],
      "text": "provision of treatment support, there were higher rates of mortality, loss to follow-up and failure, and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.990646362304688,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        181.49464416503906,
        527.5325927734375,
        195.93763732910156
      ],
      "text": "lower rates of successful treatment, cure and treatment adherence among patients who had treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.963740348815918,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        194.69459533691406,
        527.4432373046875,
        209.13758850097656
      ],
      "text": "support administered by a family member. Therefore, although treatment support by a health-care",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        207.8946075439453,
        527.404541015625,
        222.3376007080078
      ],
      "text": "worker, trained lay provider and family member showed advantages compared to SAT, provision by",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        221.09474182128906,
        527.4422607421875,
        235.53773498535156
      ],
      "text": "trained lay providers and health-care workers are the preferred options for treatment support, with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        234.29469299316406,
        393.4686584472656,
        248.73768615722656
      ],
      "text": "the least preferred treatment support provider being a family member.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        265.13848876953125,
        219.50535583496094,
        280.7984924316406
      ],
      "text": "Treatment support location",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        286.73052978515625,
        527.43017578125,
        302.4495544433594
      ],
      "text": "(10, 12, 14, 28, 52–55)  (16, 23, 32, 34, 36, 42,  Randomized controlled trials  and observational studies",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        299.93048095703125,
        527.4478149414062,
        315.6495056152344
      ],
      "text": "56–89)  examined how the location of treatment support affected the treatment outcome. Locations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        314.406494140625,
        527.294677734375,
        328.8495178222656
      ],
      "text": "were grouped by community- or home-based treatment support and health facility-based treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.987643241882324,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        327.60650634765625,
        527.50634765625,
        342.0495300292969
      ],
      "text": "support. Community- or home-based treatment support was defined as treatment support delivered",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.983036994934082,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        340.8065185546875,
        524.4402465820312,
        355.2495422363281
      ],
      "text": "in the community that is close to the patient’s home or workplace. In general, community- or home-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        354.0065002441406,
        527.54541015625,
        368.44952392578125
      ],
      "text": "based treatment support was provided close to the patients. Health facility-based treatment support",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.999300003051758,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        367.2065124511719,
        527.6046752929688,
        381.6495361328125
      ],
      "text": "was defined as treatment support delivered at a health centre, clinic or hospital, although there",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        380.406494140625,
        524.4180908203125,
        394.8495178222656
      ],
      "text": "were some instances of community- or home-based treatment support being provided by health-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        393.60650634765625,
        527.4376220703125,
        408.0495300292969
      ],
      "text": "care workers. When comparing treatment support locations, community- or home-based treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        406.8065185546875,
        527.4078979492188,
        421.2495422363281
      ],
      "text": "support had higher rates of treatment success, cure, treatment completion and 2-month sputum",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        420.0065002441406,
        527.4276733398438,
        434.44952392578125
      ],
      "text": "conversion. Community- or home-based treatment support also had lower rates of mortality and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        433.2065124511719,
        500.1125183105469,
        447.6495361328125
      ],
      "text": "lower rates of unfavourable outcomes compared with health facility-based treatment support.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        454.910400390625,
        527.2867431640625,
        469.3534240722656
      ],
      "text": "When comparing community/home-based treatment support or health facility-based treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        468.11041259765625,
        527.5867309570312,
        482.5534362792969
      ],
      "text": "support with SAT, there were no significant differences across the outcomes in randomized controlled",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.985190391540527,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        481.3103942871094,
        527.5562133789062,
        495.75341796875
      ],
      "text": "trials. However, cohort studies showed higher rates of treatment success and adherence, and a lower",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.996699333190918,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        494.5104064941406,
        503.4851379394531,
        508.95343017578125
      ],
      "text": "rate of loss to follow-up, with community/home-based treatment support compared with SAT.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        516.2142944335938,
        527.321044921875,
        530.6572875976562
      ],
      "text": "Observational data from cohort studies also showed lower rates of treatment completion and slightly",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.98739242553711,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        529.4144287109375,
        515.8976440429688,
        543.857421875
      ],
      "text": "higher rates of failure and loss to follow-up in health-facility treatment support compared to SAT.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        551.1182861328125,
        527.4168701171875,
        565.561279296875
      ],
      "text": "Consequently, community- or home-based treatment support is the preferred option rather than",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        564.3182983398438,
        290.5152587890625,
        578.7612915039062
      ],
      "text": "health facility-based treatment support and SAT.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        586.022216796875,
        527.4144897460938,
        600.4652099609375
      ],
      "text": "Combining the evidence on treatment support provider and treatment support location, treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        599.22216796875,
        527.4486083984375,
        613.6651611328125
      ],
      "text": "support should preferably be delivered at home or in the community by a health-care worker or",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        612.4222412109375,
        527.376220703125,
        626.865234375
      ],
      "text": "trained lay provider. Treatment support that is delivered at a health facility or provided by a family",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        625.6221923828125,
        397.26800537109375,
        640.065185546875
      ],
      "text": "member, and treatment that is unsupported are not preferable options.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        656.4661254882812,
        253.02012634277344,
        672.1261596679688
      ],
      "text": "Video-supported treatment (VST)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        679.333984375,
        527.4168701171875,
        693.7769775390625
      ],
      "text": "For VST there were only two cohort studies from high-income countries and no data from low- and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        691.2581176757812,
        527.4164428710938,
        706.9771118164062
      ],
      "text": "(90, 91) middle-income countries  . These studies compared in-person treatment support with VST",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        705.734130859375,
        527.57080078125,
        720.1771240234375
      ],
      "text": "done in real time. Patients given VST had no statistically significant difference in treatment completion",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.983537673950195,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        718.93408203125,
        416.050537109375,
        733.3770751953125
      ],
      "text": "and mortality compared to patients who had in-person treatment support.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        740.6380004882812,
        527.1573486328125,
        755.0809936523438
      ],
      "text": "Although there is some concern as to the indirectness of evidence for VST, given that the studies were",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.981935501098633,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        753.8380126953125,
        527.4119873046875,
        768.281005859375
      ],
      "text": "conducted in high-income countries and there is uncertainty of evidence regarding the use of VST, the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.966950416564941,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        39.172698974609375,
        801.0170288085938,
        136.43409729003906,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "184 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.43649291992188,
        801.0170288085938,
        170.0604705810547,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        172.25680541992188,
        801.0170288085938,
        326.14483642578125,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis: Module 4: treatment and care",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
